  "description": "DICOMweb for Plgic.Dicom: DICOM JSON Model and Native DICOM Model (XML) serializers, a streaming multipart/related reader and writer with size limits, and an HttpClient-based QIDO-RS / WADO-RS / STOW-RS client that streams studies as IAsyncEnumerable without buffering whole responses. Requires a license key: free Developer key for development and testing, Pro / Enterprise plans for production (https://dicomkit.plogic.dev).",
